{"unit_id":"xiaoiver__dsh-unified-computer-use#card-zh","repo":"xiaoiver/dsh-unified-computer-use","commit":"1a2e9e8346faec842e8b8b6d86fc3c9d4d842a0f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Unified Computer Use（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：让 DSH 助手通过持久 JavaScript REPL 操作网页和本机应用。插件注册 cua_repl 与重置工具，在 DSH Host 中启动独立 Chrome，并按需连接原生应用控制。可浏览、读取和操作网页，查看窗口状态、截图并执行桌面操作。适合需要让助手处理网页或本机界面任务的用户；网页操作要求 Host 已安装 Chrome，macOS 原生操作需系统权限。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host-plugin.ts:40-43","src/browser-playwright.ts:39-60","src/native.ts:87-112"]}
